      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn maps from 1914 reveal Summerhill’s downtown layout, showing businesses, schools, and hotels that once defined the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
