      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Summerhill%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Thomas and Barbara Croyle’s two‑story stone homestead still stands today, once serving as a fortress against Indian attacks.",
